 "id": "7699993220035742", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28168877656053998"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "332643316187551"}]}, "change_log": "separated the camera and file permissions in free draw", "created_date": 1786728715, "id": "28168877656053998", "version": "1.6.3", "version_code": 163, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28168872949387802"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7699993220035742", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28168877656053998"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "332643316187551"}]}, "change_log": "Cats & Cameras!\n\nWe've released a new content pack with 6 new lessons on drawing cats!  \n6 new lessons and a bunch of new assets for 2D Free Draw\n\nWe're also adding a new feature in 2D Free Draw allowing you to capture the world around you and trace it. \n\nWhile in 2d Free Draw, go to \"My Files\", grant the appropriate permissions, then you can take a picture of the world around you.  Be sure to check \"Headset Cameras\" in the permission options. \n\nAfter capturing the image, it'll show up on our easel for you to trace in the normal way.  The image is saved so you can quit and resume your drawing, but once you take a new photo, the old one is gone.  So if you want to remove the current one, just take another. ", "created_date": 1771513472, "id": "26169937922614658", "version": "1.6.0", "version_code": 160, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26169934